      <activity id="9d815a1b-b44e-5a42-8e29-0f18126220ac" activityNameId="7a7919f5-3c30-5364-957c-432d1f3c6f79" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural gas, production SA, at long-distance pipeline</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural gas, production SA, at long-distance pipeline
In 2023 100% of the imported Saudi Arabian natural gas to RoW was imported by pipeline and 0% as LNG. An average distance of 0 km is estimated for the pipeline export from Saudi Arabia, of which are 0 km offshore pipeline. The estimated shipping distance for LNG are  km. The net calorific value of natural is 36.0 MJ/Nm³. UUID=6d79c161-be0b-36de-90f9-1fa4f4754177
This dataset describes the transport needed for an average export of Saudi Arabian natural gas. Gas losses and emissions during seasonal storage are included.
Location: The data for storage emissions are based on global data. The amount of gas stored is a rough estimate based on European data. The average weighted transport distance is based on the trade movements 2019.
Technology: The distance is an European average based on the European long-distance pipeline network and LNG shipping routes.
Time period: Transport modes investigated for 2023.
Production volume: not known
Sampling: Literature.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6d79c161-be0b-36de-90f9-1fa4f4754177.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
